-platform/commit/32d478d521cf6dbd69c10537c4925d314c665139","message":"Record target Windows updater trampoline evidence","parents":["54050e70e4b177871c50388bb63ab1e088286758"],"sha":"32d478d521cf6dbd69c10537c4925d314c665139"},{"author_date":"2026-09-29T04:57:57Z","committer_date":"2026-09-29T04:57:57Z","html_url":"https://github.com/BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform/commit/7fda8192129755accbe8c35098a8295032fecc87","message":"Fix platform update request reconciliation","parents":["32d478d521cf6dbd69c10537c4925d314c665139"],"sha":"7fda8192129755accbe8c35098a8295032fecc87"}],"issue_comments":[],"issue_reactions":[],"pr_number":183,"pull_request":{"base":{"ref":"main","repo":"BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform","repo_id":1326588757,"repo_node_id":"R_kgDOTxIjVQ","sha":"24ed938c587c9d3e2288c92bc156ccc476c955f3"},"body":"## Summary\n\nAdds `platform_update_v1` behind the existing `procedure_run` surface.\n\nSupported actions are intentionally closed:\n\n- `check`\n- `request_update`\n- `status`\n\nThe procedure reuses the existing installed official-main updater and accepts no repository, branch, path, command, executable, environment, backend, or credential selector.\n\n## Research\n\nFresh Stage Research: `project-context/PLATFORM_UPDATE_PROCEDURE_V1_RESEARCH.md`\n\nDecision: **NARROW**.\n\n## Key properties\n\n- six public semantic tools remain unchanged;\n- update source remains fixed to `BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform/main`;\n- `request_update` returns only launch acceptance and explicitly sets `outcome_verified=false`;\n- terminal result/state remain owned by the existing updater files;\n- no generic shell/process surface is added.\n\n## Required gates\n\n- focused tests\n- hosted CI/security checks\n- fresh independent ordinary-ChatGPT semantic review on exact BASE..HEAD\n- target-Windows physical check before merge\n","closed_at":null,"created_at":"2026-09-28T21:29:19Z","draft":true,"head":{"ref":"feature/platform-update-procedure-v1","repo":"BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform","